// The carrier: the enemy in a boarding action. A big, slow, two-decked
// ship crewed by robots, its shield console on the bridge at the far end
// from its hangar door. Ship coordinates, metres: +Y up, bow toward -Z.
// See docs/ships.md.
Design(
    name: "CARRIER",
    hostile: true,
    model: Some("ships/carrier/carrier.glb"),
    shield: (center: (0.0, 3.2, 0.0), radii: (11.0, 8.0, 36.0)),
    // On top of the dorsal spine (whose top is at y = 7.6), and under the keel.
    turrets: [(0.0, 8.1, -8.0), (0.0, -0.8, 4.0)],
    modules: [(module: "carrier/hull")],
)
